==Description==
The '''SparkleTime Nametag''' is a {{Color|Legendary}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''SparkleTime Nametag''' has sky blue and cyan text adorned with a white gleam that traverses the middle of each letter. Additionally, the nametag emits sparkling particles around it making it look like it is shining. The nametag is accompanied with a translucent black outline.

==Trivia==
*The inventory description of the '''SparkleTime Nametag''' is a reference to the description of the {{RLinkC|1285307|Sparkle Time Fedora}} from the Roblox catalog.

